spoilers

When you put on speed boots, 1 of 3 things can happen:

You feel yourself speed up.   If you have no other speed abilities.
This will double your current speed.

You feel yourself speed up a bit more.  If you have intrinsic speed.
This takes you from 1.3x normal speed to 2x normal speed.

No message.  If you had recently quaffed a potion of speed or casted
haste self.
No effect since you already were at 2x normal speed.

Intrinsic speed can be gained all sorts of ways:
comes with character at certain level
wand of speed zapped at yourself
eating certain corpses or tins
granted by your diety

Note that all of these are 1.3 times normal speed.


The ONLY ways to get 2x speed are from:
speed boots
potion of speed
haste spell

Note: the only way your character can go under 1x speed is with the "aid"
      of a heavy iron ball.  Zapping a wand of slow monster at yourself
      doesn't affect your own speed.
